## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Job misfire grace time**: APScheduler by default may skip a job execution if the scheduler was busy. Should we add `misfire_grace_time` (e.g., 30s) to the `add_job()` call to allow late-firing jobs to still execute?

> [!NOTE]
> **interval_minutes update**: When a monitor's `interval_minutes` is updated via `PATCH /api/monitors/{id}`, the scheduler job should be rescheduled with the new interval. The plan includes this, but confirm: should a manual `PATCH` also reset the "next run time" immediately, or just let the current interval finish?

